    "rating": 2.3,
    "reference": "ChIJdeLsnHVSyUwRsK06N_hTAYo",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Dalia Mekawi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114875193370955310474/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJd64k92ub4BkuPly_LndaCzHdo7kNeZOS53dq6qHSJKZxD7w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I was scared when i was referred for my pregnancy to this clinic, but the clinic and Dr. Lisette Haddad have been nothing short of wonderful.\n\nThey respond to online requests through their portal within a few business days, Dr. Haddad was great during the pregnancy follow ups as well and very reassuring and calm during the whole process.",
        "time": 1754361644,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anita Greco",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103349825636512673531/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjrgZvFsQovGC_hxPpGe41iBKkdkKTU7ZrASu8rnTDNpZ3hc7P=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The clinic emailed me a date and time for an appointment, without consulting me to see if that worked for me. I then called, but the message said they don't take calls. Could not find an email address. Finally cancelled on their website. This mode of functioning does not work for me. And to be threatened with fees if I don't cancel in time. Seriously. Treat people with respect. I do not wish to be a client of this clinic anymore. Do not contact me again.",
        "time": 1712771147,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marieta Ionescu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114809640533788317858/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxFnOhcrWNQsFtLcwTy1YqQLs0AWM3L3Hvb3PH1YFDZXyIq8X5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A bad experience from the first meeting. I had received the wrong appointment time, I arrived 5 minutes late. They didn't even want to take me For my first appointment. They don't even deserve one star. There is no telephone service either. Not at all professional.",
        "time": 1738705934,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nessa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114757373245165511002/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6cBxQxccYXIB5B5LUzK9OavboLknLjXPqtM51GY3K5B3-zSLfdA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Dr Lisette Haddad is amazing! This was my second pregnancy and I asked for her because I had her for one appointment during my first pregnancy. She was everything you'd want from a doctor. She never missed my appointments, was gentle and made me feel safe.",
        "time": 1723755881,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Megg",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100537310457430601899/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXGOGokhUQUAlRsU679lxRViVqVZQbyVP3No6kmtelf6bdaspDU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "PLEASE READ-\n\nMy doctor was amazing and he made sure I had a good delivery, BUT that’s where the good of this review ends.\n\nThis place has so much wrong with it, the location, the extremely horrible wait times… however this review is much more than that simple stuff-\n\nYou see I was 1 week postpartum after a traumatic birth and had a appointment scheduled, the problem was I couldn’t seem to cancel it. Confused I tried to call- but there was no ring, it went straight to voicemail. So worried it was important to go I drove the 1 hour drive with my newborn left at home with his dad. On the way I even attempted to call/ Email them- unfortunately there was no way to contact the business, even while they were open.\n\nThis is when things get WAY WORSE !!!!\n\nI get in and I’m exhausted and tell the secretary who is sitting right by a stupid useless phone my name, and she makes this- ohhh gosh oops- type of face. She looks at me and says “didn’t you already have your baby?”\n\nI was dumbfounded. I replied yes but that I had this appointment and tried to call.\n\nSo this woman says “oh we aren’t taking calls” as if I don’t realize that. She sat there next to a phone looking so dumb as she then tells me with a sour little expression “just go home”\n\nSeriously- her response to me was almost cruel, no apology and no remorse.\nShe shrugged and went back to typing on the computer and that was all I got.\n\nThen I never saw my doctor again, they never contacted me again about me or my babies health and trying to contact this place is nearly impossible.\n\nI say if a doctor tries to recommend this place just ask for something else, you deserve better.\n\n(P.s- They even charge you if you don’t show up for your appointments but then have no decent way for you to contact them)",
        "time": 1706046216,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
